## Everything else is original

The Japanese course content — the kana, vocabulary, grammar points, kanji
entries, their glosses, readings and example sentences — is written for this
project. The spoken audio in `api/storage/audio/` is synthesised locally by
`tools/generate-audio.py` from that original text.
